{"id":"word:hebrew:H2143","type":"word","title":"זֵכֶר","subtitle":"H2143 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a memento , abstractly recollection (rarely if ever); by implication, commemoration","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to זֵכֶר (H2143) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 23 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"זֵכֶר (zêker) means a memento , abstractly recollection (rarely if ever); by implication, commemoration First listed occurrence: Deut 25 19."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"זֵכֶר","transliteration":"zêker","pronunciation":"zay'-ker","strong":"H2143","lemmaId":"hebrew:H2143","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["זֵ֣כֶר","זִכְרָֽ/ם","לְ/זֵ֣כֶר","וְ/זִכְרָ֖/ם","זִכְרִ֖/י"],"morphs":[["HNcmsc/Sp3mp",5],["HNcmsc",4],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",3],["HR/Ncmsc",3],["HNcmsa",2],["HNcmsc/Sp2ms",2],["HC/Ncmsc/Sp3mp",1],["HNcmsc/Sp1cs",1],["HC/R/Ncmsc/Sp2ms",1],["HC/Ncmsc/Sp2ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"a memento , abstractly recollection (rarely if ever); by implication, commemoration","usage":"memorial, memory, remembrance, scent.","full":"H2143. zeker II. זֶ֫כֶר noun masculine Exod 17:14 , see following. זֵ֫כֶר noun masculine Psa 9:7 remembrance, memorial (compare Hpt Hebraica. 1885, 230 ) — ׳ז absolute 111:4 ; construct Deut 25:19 +; זֶכֶר construct Exod 17:14 van d. H; suffix זִכְרִי 3:15 , זִכְרְךָ Isa 26:8 +, זִכְרֶ֑ךָ Psa 6:6 , זִכְרוֺ Hosea 12:6 +, זִכְרָם Deut 32:26 +: — 1 remembrance, memory: a. of persons or people, blotted out by their destruction , Exod 17:14 (E; with מחה ) = Deut 25:19 ; 32:26 ( השׁבית ) Psa 34:17 ; 109:15 (both הכרית ), 9:7 ( אבד ), Job 18:17 ( אבד ; || שֵׁם ), Isa 26:14 ( אבּד ); compare on other hand ׳ז עוֺלָם as portion of righteous. b. of ׳י Psa 6:6 ; 102:13 (|| אַתָּה = יהוה ). c. of ׳י s character and works Psa 30:5 ; 97:12 ; 111:4 . d. remembrance of particular days, i.e. their observance Est 9:28 ( יְמֵי הַמּוּרִים ). 2 memorial , by which one is remembered: a. nearly = ׳ז לִבְרָכָה צַדִּיק שֵׁם, Prov 10:7 (|| שֵׁם ), compare also Eccl 9:5 (with נשׁכח ); especially of ׳י Exod 3:15 (E), Hosea 12:6 ; Isa 26:8 ; Psa 135:13 (all || שֵׁם ). b. = renown (of Israel) Hosea 14:8 (compare VB).","rootNote":"or זֶכֶר ; from 2142 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"Deut 25 19","keyReferences":["Deut 25 19","Deut 32 26","Eccl 9 5","Esth 9 28","Exod 3 15","Exod 17 14","Hos 12 6","Hos 14 8"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":23,"occurrences":[{"reference":"Deut 25 19","book":"Deut","chapter":25,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"זֵ֣כֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Deut 32 26","book":"Deut","chapter":32,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"זִכְרָֽ/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"Eccl 9 5","book":"Eccl","chapter":9,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"זִכְרָֽ/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"Esth 9 28","book":"Esth","chapter":9,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/זִכְרָ֖/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"Exod 3 15","book":"Exod","chapter":3,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"זִכְרִ֖/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"Exod 17 14","book":"Exod","chapter":17,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"זֵ֣כֶר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Hos 12 6","book":"Hos","chapter":12,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"זִכְרֽ/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Hos 14 8","book":"Hos","chapter":14,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"זִכְר֖/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Isa 26 8","book":"Isa","chapter":26,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּֽ/לְ/זִכְרְ/ךָ֖","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncmsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Isa 26 14","bo